{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>For it is better</b> — that he say to you, \"Come up here and stand with us,\" than that he humble you before a noble by saying to you, \"Step away from me.\"" "<b>they see</b> — your humiliation." "<b>they see</b> — in place of יראו (\"they fear\")."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:35.240118010Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}